{"data":{"content":"//// `gleam dev` serves the app at http://localhost:8000 (or `gleam dev 8001` for\n//// another port) and rebuilds it whenever a source file changes. `gleam dev\n//// publish` instead puts the files to deploy in public/. The work is in\n//// animator_dev_ffi.mjs.\n\nconst default_port = 8000\n\n@external(javascript, \"./animator_dev_ffi.mjs\", \"start\")\nfn start(default_port: Int) -> Nil\n\npub fn main() -> Nil {\n  start(default_port)\n}\n","line_count":14,"path":"dev/animator_dev.gleam","sha256":"d15588d5e8eec3b4f023c1b1abd0775a232ba874dbdf5f0b637a645a366fbdd6"},"hash":"4152f595e62b09ac87dd650fb4cc0367e413253ebfd4970d365891c14d886353","kind":"doc.open","prev_hash":"a7fb81265b380a23949a9a011cb9767a85a12c7dd0df1d3c2bc6396a79172b55","seq":307,"t":7367074,"wall":"2026-11-20T01:36:36.798Z"}
